     "d": "<ul><li>Polydipsia</li><li>Decreased osmolar intake<ul><li><b>Abuse/neglect*</b></li><li>Inappropriate formula</li></ul></li><li>Water intoxication<ul><li><b>Abuse/neglect*</b></li><li>Inappropriate formula</li><li>Iatrogenic</li></ul></li></ul>"
