     "d": "<b>Why is ADH present?</b><br>Check clinical volume status"
    },
    {
     "id": "i1",
     "k": "dx",
     "t": "Hypovolemic",
     "d": "<ul><li>Renal (UNa &gt;20, FENa &gt;1%)<ul><li>Osmotic diuresis (Eg. <b>Diabetic Ketoacidosis*</b>)</li><li>Hypoaldosteronism</li><li>Diuretics</li><li>Polyuric Acute Tubular Necrosis</li></ul></li><li>Extra renal (UNa&lt;10, FENa &lt;1%)<ul><li>GI losses (<b>gastroenteritis*, pyloric stenosis*</b>)</li><li>Insensible losses (<b>Cystic Fibrosis*, Burns*</b>)</li></ul></li></ul>"
    },
    {
