     "t": "Low intravascular volume (↓EABV)",
     "d": "<p>(Low UNa esp. &lt;20):</p><ul><li><b>Congestive heart failure*</b></li><li><b>Nephrotic syndrome*</b></li><li><b>Nephritis syndrome*</b></li><li><b>Sepsis*</b> with capillary leak</li></ul>"
